  "Extortion claims are global: RansomLook does not record the victim's country, so there is no U.S. share until ransomware.live is cleared and turned on.",
  "Outages and Advisories & news only reach back a few weeks (status pages and news feeds return recent history only), so their recent rise is the record filling in, not a trend.",
  "U.S. incident dates are disclosure dates, and confirmed breaches often surface weeks after they happen, so the latest weeks will grow as disclosures arrive.",
  "90 days describes the current pace, not the next quarter. The history builds up with every run."
